{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/consultations/modified-proposals-for-local-government-reorganisation-in-west-sussex","content_id":"d785b16d-eafe-44ef-837b-4ee6cf50f17f","description":"This consultation seeks views on a potential modification to a proposal for local government reorganisation in West Sussex.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9284697","isbn":"","title":"Modified proposals for local government reorganisation in West Sussex","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/consultations/modified-proposals-for-local-government-reorganisation-in-west-sussex/modified-proposals-for-local-government-reorganisation-in-west-sussex"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>We are seeking views on potential modification to the 2 unitary proposal for the reorganisation of local government in West Sussex.</p>\n\n<p>The 2 unitary proposal was submitted by:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Adur District Council</li>\n  <li>Arun District Council</li>\n  <li>Chichester District Council</li>\n  <li>Crawley Borough Council</li>\n  <li>Horsham District Council</li>\n  <li>Mid-Sussex District Council</li>\n  <li>Worthing Borough Council   </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>​​Responses to this consultation will inform the Secretary of State’s decision on which proposal, if any, to implement.​</p>\n\n<div role=\"note\" aria-label=\"Information\" class=\"application-notice info-notice\">\n  <p>View our first consultation on <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-east-sussex-and-brighton-and-hove-and-west-sussex\">local government reorganisation in East Sussex and Brighton and Hove, and West Sussex</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-12T09:08:00Z"}],"closing_date":"2026-06-15T23:59:00.000+01:00","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5f